finding: src/extras/multiplayer/room-host.ts:205–227,605–612: admission tracks the room, not the join attempt. In a scratch probe, two connect calls with the same open Connection in a pinned room (capacity 2) ran separate deferred hooks. Resolving only the first printed `joined old` while the second auth was unresolved; resolving the second printed `joined new` on the same transport. The first completion also deletes the second controller from the abort map. Bun upgrades use distinct wrappers, but the host does not enforce single-use connections or bind completion to its reservation. src/extras/multiplayer/game.ts:409–415: WebSocket construction can throw with the credential-bearing URL before sanitization. Bun 1.4.5 reproduces this with ftp://localhost/ and credential=secret: `SyntaxError: Wrong url scheme for WebSocket ftp://localhost/?credential=secret`. Initialization exposes that error instead of the sanitized endpoint.
